{"unit_id":"konata__btw#card-zh","repo":"konata/btw","commit":"c3ea820d4ac420e76375758fa834c417c4b486a1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"btw 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的并行侧聊插件，在主会话右侧栏打开独立的会话面板。它创建继承主会话工作区、工具、权限和模型选择的子会话，并将最近对话摘要作为上下文。用户可以通过侧栏按钮、/side 或 /btw 命令及快捷键打开或新建侧聊；主会话和侧聊还可分别使用 send_to_side 与 send_to_main 传递消息。适合希望并行处理问题、同时保留主线对话背景的 DSH 用户。需要 DSH 0.2.1-rc.1 或更高版本，不需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:150-189","src/index.ts:123-131","src/index.ts:194-225","src/index.ts:258-289","src/client/index.tsx:296-331"]}
{"unit_id":"konata__btw#card-en","repo":"konata/btw","commit":"c3ea820d4ac420e76375758fa834c417c4b486a1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"btw adds parallel side chats to DSH Web's right sidebar. Child chats inherit the main session's workspace, tools, permissions, model, and recent context. Open them with /side, /btw, a shortcut, or the sidebar. send_to_side and send_to_main pass messages between chats. Requires DSH 0.2.1-rc.1+.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:150-189","src/index.ts:123-131","src/index.ts:194-225","src/index.ts:258-289","src/client/index.tsx:296-331"]}
{"unit_id":"konata__btw#intent-1","repo":"konata/btw","commit":"c3ea820d4ac420e76375758fa834c417c4b486a1","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"我想在主会话旁边开个独立对话，同时带上最近的聊天背景。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:102-104","src/index.ts:123-131"]}
