{"unit_id":"konata__btw#feature-1","repo":"konata/btw","commit":"c3ea820d4ac420e76375758fa834c417c4b486a1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"btw 的功能「带上下文创建侧聊」：在当前 DSH 会话旁创建独立子会话，继承模型路由、权限预设和工作区，并注入近期主会话摘要。通过侧栏新建按钮触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:150-189","src/index.ts:102-131"]}
{"unit_id":"konata__btw#feature-2","repo":"konata/btw","commit":"c3ea820d4ac420e76375758fa834c417c4b486a1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"btw 的功能「主侧聊消息互传」：主会话可用 send_to_side 向最近或指定侧聊发送任务，侧聊可用 send_to_main 将发现作为消息发回主会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:194-225","src/index.ts:258-289"]}
{"unit_id":"konata__btw#feature-3","repo":"konata/btw","commit":"c3ea820d4ac420e76375758fa834c417c4b486a1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"btw 的功能「命令与快捷键打开」：通过 /side、/btw 命令或主键加 Alt+S 快捷键打开最近侧聊；若尚无侧聊则创建一个。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:193-207","src/client/index.tsx:296-331"]}
{"unit_id":"konata__btw#feature-4","repo":"konata/btw","commit":"c3ea820d4ac420e76375758fa834c417c4b486a1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"btw 的功能「恢复未关闭侧聊」：主会话重新加载后，根据子会话记录恢复仍打开的侧聊，并略过已关闭的项目；再次打开时重新连接子 Agent。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:314-332","src/index.ts:228-253"]}
{"unit_id":"konata__btw#feature-5","repo":"konata/btw","commit":"c3ea820d4ac420e76375758fa834c417c4b486a1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"btw 的功能「关闭并记住侧聊」：关闭右侧标签时取消并释放子 Agent，将会话 ID 写入关闭标记，避免后续恢复该侧聊。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:56-64","src/index.ts:370-380","src/client/index.tsx:289-294"]}
{"unit_id":"konata__btw#caveat-1","repo":"konata/btw","commit":"c3ea820d4ac420e76375758fa834c417c4b486a1","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"btw 使用 DSH_HOME 指定数据目录，或默认写入用户目录下的 .dsh/btw/closed.json；关闭侧聊仅记录关闭状态，相关会话日志仍由 DSH 保存在本机。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:41-42","src/index.ts:56-64"]}
{"unit_id":"konata__btw#caveat-2","repo":"konata/btw","commit":"c3ea820d4ac420e76375758fa834c417c4b486a1","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"侧聊上下文是在创建或重新连接时从主会话读取的近期消息摘要；后续主会话的新消息不会自动同步到已打开的侧聊。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:102-104","src/index.ts:237-247"]}
